{"id":"b6049c7d1fa77e31","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-ax-hilbert-forall-instantiation.md","title":"∀-Instantiation Axiom Schema","display":"ax-hilbert-forall-instantiation — ∀-Instantiation Axiom Schema","type":"axiom","metadata":{"type":"axiom","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-ax-hilbert-forall-instantiation","aliases":["58-ax-hilbert-forall-instantiation"],"display":"ax-hilbert-forall-instantiation — ∀-Instantiation Axiom Schema","depends_on":["[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-substitution-formula.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-free-for.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"axiom"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-ax-hilbert-forall-instantiation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-ax-hilbert-forall-instantiation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ax-hilbert-forall-instantiation — ∀-Instantiation Axiom Schema"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"60d957ce43061cb6\" href=\"?note=60d957ce43061cb6\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-substitution-formula.md\">../batch11/58-df-substitution-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8ad179c98b9a237c\" href=\"?note=8ad179c98b9a237c\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-free-for.md\">../batch06/58-df-free-for.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\\in V\">\\(\\Sigma\\in V\\)</span> (一阶签名参数, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span> (语法对象, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FreeFor}_\\Sigma(t,x,\\varphi)\">\\(\\mathrm{FreeFor}_\\Sigma(t,x,\\varphi)\\)</span> (签名参数化的自由代入条件, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8ad179c98b9a237c\" href=\"?note=8ad179c98b9a237c\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-free-for.md\">../batch06/58-df-free-for.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SubFml}_\\Sigma(\\varphi,t,x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{SubFml}_\\Sigma(\\varphi,t,x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span> (公式代入, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"60d957ce43061cb6\" href=\"?note=60d957ce43061cb6\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-substitution-formula.md\">../batch11/58-df-substitution-formula.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ax\\text{-}hilbert\\text{-}forall\\text{-}instantiation} \\vdash \\forall \\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\\forall t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{FreeFor}_\\Sigma(t,x,\\varphi)\\to(\\forall x\\,\\varphi\\to\\mathrm{SubFml}_\\Sigma(\\varphi,t,x))\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ax\\text{-}hilbert\\text{-}forall\\text{-}instantiation} \\vdash \\forall \\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\\forall t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{FreeFor}_\\Sigma(t,x,\\varphi)\\to(\\forall x\\,\\varphi\\to\\mathrm{SubFml}_\\Sigma(\\varphi,t,x))\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>该公理表达全称量词的<strong>实例化规则</strong></li>\n<li>若项 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 中自由，则从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x\\;\\varphi\">\\(\\forall x\\;\\varphi\\)</span> 可推出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi[t/x]\">\\(\\varphi[t/x]\\)</span></li>\n<li><strong>自由度条件</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FreeFor}_\\Sigma(t,x,\\varphi)\">\\(\\mathrm{FreeFor}_\\Sigma(t,x,\\varphi)\\)</span> 确保替换不导致约束变元捕获，并防止不同签名的项与公式混用。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-substitution-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"60d957ce43061cb6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-substitution-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-free-for.md","status":"resolved","id":"8ad179c98b9a237c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-free-for.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma\\in V$ (一阶签名参数, see [[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":